WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes is enough to pause. But does it equal an hour of meditation?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A six-week study improved attention with interactive practice, not a passive soundtrack.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Another study compared ten and thirty minutes, and found no detected difference on its chosen measures.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That is not the same as proving a sixty-minute equivalence for Zen12.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Choose a recording for its format, not an unverified promise about your brain.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources, try a free practice, and decide what genuinely serves your routine.
